OL,3,GNEWSAGrass fire jumps over road to
OL,4,Acontinue burning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grass fire spread across a road and
OL,7,Finto more fields, making firefighters'
OL,8,Fjobs more difficult, who took nearly
OL,9,Ffour hours to put it out.
OL,11,FSix Royal Berkshire Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService (RBFRS) crews were sent to the
OL,13,Ffields off Park Lane in Swallowfield at
OL,14,Fabout 11:15 BST.
OL,16,FOther crews from Surrey and
OL,17,FBuckinghamshire were drafted into help,
OL,18,Fwhich affected about three hectares
OL,19,F(7.4 acres) of land.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
